          "level": 2,
          "content": "6.1 Numbers Tell us Things"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.342,
            0.64,
            0.365
          ],
          "content": "What do the numbers in the figure below tell us?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.373,
            0.847,
            0.412
          ],
          "content": "Remember the children from the Grade 6 textbook of mathematics? Now, they call out numbers using a different rule."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.326,
            0.418,
            0.711,
            0.586
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_8.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.598,
            0.564,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": "What do you think these numbers mean?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.63,
            0.847,
            0.668
          ],
          "content": "The children rearrange themselves and each one says a number based on the new arrangement."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.313,
            0.683,
            0.709,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_11.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.864,
            0.847,
            0.904
          ],
          "content": "？ Could you figure out what these numbers convey? Observe and try to find out."
        },
